kojo
https://github.com/jemdiggity/kojo
MIT License, at kojo 90c4e23.
================================================================================

Derived from kojo:

  crates/kanna-pipe
      A Rust port of kojo's factory language, src/kojo/factory_spec.py:
      the line grammar (stages, flow lines with pass, fail, max N, reset
      and progress, comments), errors as FILE:LINE: message, the checks
      in validate() (undefined stages, verdict-only pass and fail,
      progress and reset sources and destinations, reachability, a max
      on every loop), Factory.pick, Factory.worst and max_sessions, and
      verdict_of. Kanna's stage kinds (agents, run, ask, merge), its
      attributes (each, emits, on, within, resume), the budget and
      revisions are Kanna's.

