Kanna v3
================================================================================

Derived from Kanna v3:

  crates/kanna-detect
      The version probe and the foreground-program check, ported from Kanna
      v3's crates/kanna3-detect and crates/kanna3d's terminal.rs.
  tools/agent-harness/mock_server.py
      From Kanna v3's tools/characterize/mock_server.py (the scripted
      Anthropic Messages, OpenAI Responses and Chat Completions server);
      record.py and run.py follow its record.py and run_all.py.

================================================================================
Linked libraries
================================================================================

Kanna.app links, unmodified:

  merman 0.8.0 (https://github.com/Latias94/merman), MIT OR Apache-2.0,
      through crates/kanna-merman.
  swift-markdown 0.7.3 (https://github.com/swiftlang/swift-markdown),
      Apache-2.0, and swift-cmark (cmark-gfm), BSD-2-Clause and MIT, as
      published by the Swift project.
  tree-sitter and tree-sitter-highlight 0.27 (https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter),
      MIT, with these grammars and the queries they ship, through
      crates/kanna-syntax: tree-sitter-rust, -swift, -typescript,
      -javascript, -python, -go, -c, -cpp, -bash, -json, -html and -css
      (MIT), tree-sitter-toml-ng and tree-sitter-yaml (MIT), and
      tree-sitter-svelte-ng (MIT), each at the version Cargo.lock pins.

Kanna.app includes, vendored unmodified:

  tree-sitter-vue (https://github.com/tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-vue),
      MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 Amaan Qureshi, at ce8011a: the generated
      parser and scanner and its vue and html_tags queries, in
      crates/kanna-syntax/vendor/tree-sitter-vue with its LICENSE. Svelte
      also uses those html_tags queries. Neovim-only parts of the queries
      (Lua patterns, spell captures) are translated as they are loaded,
      in crates/kanna-syntax/src/languages.rs.

